			&lt;/tr&gt;
	&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;-contributing&#34;&gt;🤝 Contributing
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;We welcome contributions from the community! See &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;CONTRIBUTING.md&#34; &gt;CONTRIBUTING.md&lt;/a&gt; for guidelines and &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;docs/developer-guide.md&#34; &gt;docs/developer-guide.md&lt;/a&gt; for local development workflows.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please read the &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/alibaba/page-agent/issues/349&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;maintainer&amp;rsquo;s note&lt;/a&gt; on principles and current state.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Contributions generated entirely by &lt;strong&gt;bots or AI&lt;/strong&gt; without substantial human involvement will &lt;strong&gt;not be accepted&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;-license&#34;&gt;⚖️ License
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;LICENSE&#34; &gt;MIT License&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;-acknowledgments&#34;&gt;👏 Acknowledgments
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;This project builds upon the excellent work of &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/browser-use/browser-use&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;&lt;code&gt;browser-use&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;PageAgent&lt;/code&gt; is designed for &lt;strong&gt;client-side web enhancement&lt;/strong&gt;, not server-side automation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;
&lt;table class=&#34;lntable&#34;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;1
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;2
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;3
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;4
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;5
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;6
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;7
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;8
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;9
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-fallback&#34; data-lang=&#34;fallback&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;DOM processing components and prompt are derived from browser-use:
